<title>USA: MBIA qualifies Sevierville, Tenn..</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies Sevierville, Tenn..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp on Wednesday said that it qualified for insurance Sevierville, Tenn., $3.65 million municipal bond issue, by direct purchase.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
